    "Listed brokers and broker parents, for the 'Broker stocks' ticker feed.",
    "This feed exists because it is the one thing a broker-comparison site can show",
    "that a generic ticker cannot: how the market prices the brokers being compared.",
    "",
    "`relation` matters and must not be blurred:",
    "  self   - the broking entity itself is the listed company",
    "  parent - the listed company is the broker's parent; the broking arm is a",
    "           subsidiary and its results are only part of what this share price",
    "           reflects. Saying 'HDFC Bank' is HDFC Securities would be wrong.",
    "",
    "bse_scrip codes are resolved by joining NSE and BSE equity masters on ISIN",
    "(pipeline/symbolmap.py). Quotes come from BSE getScripHeaderData because NSE's",
    "per-symbol endpoint returns 403 to anything without a full browser sensor."
